.TH PROFILES 1 2000-1月 "dag_enrichment_profile" "dag_enrichment_profile"
.SH NAME
dag_enrichment_profile \- Create the catalog profiles data of the GO enrichment result by the GO DAG term
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIdag_enrichment_profile(\fBenrichments\fR as any, 
\fBobo\fR as <generic> GO_OBO, 
\fBroot\fR as string, 
\fBtop\fR as integer = 10, 
\fBpvalue_cut\fR as double = 1, 
\fBsort\fR as boolean = TRUE, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create the catalog profiles data of the GO enrichment result by the GO DAG term
 hierarchy, the terms are grouped by the child node of the given root term.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBenrichments\fB \fR\- the kobas [EnrichmentTerm](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Microarray.KOBAS.EnrichmentTerm) or gcmodeller [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult).. 
.PP
.PP
\fBobo\fB \fR\- the GO obo database that is used for creating the DAG graph.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBroot\fB \fR\- 
 the root term id
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtop\fB \fR\- display the top n enriched GO terms of each catalog.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBpvalue_cut\fB \fR\- the p-value cutoff of the enrichment terms. Default \fB1\fR means no filtering.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBsort\fB \fR\- sorts the terms of each catalog by the \fB-log10(p)\fR score? Default \fBTRUE\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [CatalogProfiles](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.ComponentModel.Annotation.CatalogProfiles) object, the name of each catalog is the child term of
 the given **root** and the value is the enriched GO terms of that branch.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
profiles
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
